              {
                "_type": "span",
                "_key": "costudy-s-0-b-0-s",
                "marks": [],
                "text": "We started from the prompt and brainstormed about 16 ideas, from micro-volunteering to a neighbourhood emergency app. Then we picked one together: an automatic study-group generator that would put students into groups and assign a spot on campus. The prototype ended up with students hosting their own sessions instead."
